  "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef la_pca_from_scratch(X: list, n_components: int = 2) -> dict:\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **PCA from Scratch** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef la_pca_from_scratch(X: list, n_components: int = 2) -> dict:\n    arr = np.array(X, dtype=np.float64)\n    N = arr.shape[0]\n    cen = arr - np.mean(arr, axis=0)\n    cov = np.dot(cen.T, cen) / max(N - 1, 1)\n    evals, evecs = np.linalg.eigh(cov)\n    idx = np.argsort(evals)[::-1]\n    evals, evecs = evals[idx], evecs[:, idx]\n    k = int(n_components)\n    top_vecs = evecs[:, :k]\n    return {'transformed': np.round(np.dot(cen, top_vecs), 6).tolist(), 'components': np.round(top_vecs.T, 6).tolist(), 'explained_variance_ratio': np.round(evals[:k]/np.sum(evals), 4).tolist()}\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
